    "description": "This NCEI accession contains monthly interpolated sea surface fugacity of carbon dioxide (fCO2) from 1982 through 2015 is estimated from monthly atmospheric CO2, temperature, and salinity. Firstly, the disequilibrium between the observed seawater fCO2 and fCO2air (i.e., \u00ce\u0094fCO2; \u00ce\u0094fCO2 = fCO2 \u00e2\u0080\u0093 fCO2air) is estimated using a bayesian-neural-network approach for each 1\u00c2\u00b0\u00c3\u00971\u00c2\u00b0 grid box in the MAB and the SAB. The input parameters are latitude, longitude, SST, and SSS. The output parameter is \u00ce\u0094fCO2. The feedforward backpropagation network is constructed by two hidden layers with tanh activation functions. The neural network is trained with the Levenberg-Marquardt algorithm (Hagan and Menhaj, 1994). Then fCO2 is calculated using \u00ce\u0094fCO2 and fCO2air. Next, continuous monthly SST and SSS data from 1982 to 2015 are used to calculate output with the trained network to fill in SOCAT data gaps. Monthly pH, DIC, and \u00e2\u0084\u00a6arag are calculated from fCO2 and salinity-derived TA using CO2SYS (Van Heuven et al., 2009) with the first and second dissociation constants of carbonic acid in seawater (K1 and K2) from Lueker et al. (2000) and borate-to-salinity ratio determined by Uppstr\u00c3\u00b6m (1974). TA is derived from salinity using their linear relationships in the MAB and the SAB (Cai et al., 2010).",
